```
ngOnInit: read data and profissionalId from URL. But profissionais load async; selecaoValida needs options. Read the raw id (idUrlValido) initially; validate against loaded list after load. Since backend scopes requests, an id not in the list just returns empty. But SPEC says tampered IDs don't expand access (backend handles). For UI, I'll validate after profissionais load: if profissionalId not in list, reset to null and update URL.
