- In ngOnInit: read `data` and `profissionalId` params. Set `this.data` if valid date else today's date. Set `this.profissionalFiltro = idUrlValido(param)` (may be null).
- After profissionais load, validate: if profissionalFiltro !== null and not in list, set null and atualizarUrl().

